 "name_en": "Field Logistics Analytics (6VA)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Field Logistics Analytics (6VA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioad52ecc3f7f34ba88b929e11a21c82b0\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad52ecc3f7f34ba88b929e11a21c82b0__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item supports the tracking of logistics items that meet the demand originating from the maintenance orders throughout the supply and return flows between a base and remote plant.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can view the progress of stock, non-stock and supplier (associated with a service) items based on a predefined sequence of logistics milestone events. Get information about risks that occur in the logistics journey, identify issues, and navigate to the related business documents to take required actions.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad52ecc3f7f34ba88b929e11a21c82b0__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Select a data set of maintenance orders based on different filter criteria (for example, maintenance planning buckets) in the analytical SAP Fiori app</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use the visual or standard filters to select relevant cases from the loaded data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Explore the list of orders that have risks</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Track components of maintenance orders in more detail on the object page</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Navigate to business documents</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad52ecc3f7f34ba88b929e11a21c82b0__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor the progress of the logistics items throughout the supply and return flows across plants</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View aggregated data for multiple orders with the option to focus on arising issues</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Identify risks and take further actions based on the information provided</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>现场物流分析 (6VA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioad52ecc3f7f34ba88b929e11a21c82b0\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad52ecc3f7f34ba88b929e11a21c82b0__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持在基地工厂和远程工厂之间的供应和退货流中，跟踪满足维护订单需求的物流项目。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以根据预定义的物流里程碑事件顺序查看库存项目、非库存项目和供应商（与服务相关联）项目的进度。获取有关物流旅程中发生的风险的信息，识别问题并导航到相关业务凭证以采取所需操作。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad52ecc3f7f34ba88b929e11a21c82b0__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">根据分析 SAP Fiori 应用中的不同过滤条件（例如，维护计划段）选择维护订单的数据集</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用可视或标准过滤器，从加载的数据中选择相关案例</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">浏览具有风险的订单的清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在对象页面上，更详细地跟踪维护订单的组件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">导航到业务凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioad52ecc3f7f34ba88b929e11a21c82b0__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">监控跨工厂整个供应和退货流的物流项目进度。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看多个订单的汇总数据，可以选择关注出现的问题</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据提供的信息识别风险，并采取进一步行动</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
